Jini Cloudflare Agent Plugin
Copyright 2026 Leona Burime

Portable plugin sources remain at packages/agent-plugins/cloudflare.
Moved from Tovu's bundled content/agent-plugins/cloudflare (2026-11-02); product words in prose,
comments and messages were made host-neutral. Frozen wire names (TOVU_FORMS bindings, tovu-forms-*
D1 databases, /_tovu/* receiver routes, tovu-*.json contribution files) are unchanged.
All code and skill text is original. It calls Cloudflare's public HTTP API with fetch only and links
Cloudflare's public documentation; no Cloudflare SDK or other third-party code is included.

This distribution contains plain ESM modules (deploy targets, a form destination and a Workers
form receiver) and no vendor SDK or npm dependency.
